{
  "_readme": "Voice channel layout applied by data/voice-job.json ({\"dryRun\": true} only reports). Roles: role names, or slot:<name> for roles set with /setup roles. 'from' = the channel's current exact name (or a list of possible names); no 'from' = created. divider: true = a ⎯⎯⎯ line (visible, nobody can join). Channels without their own 'access' are synced to the category, so voice channels added there later get the same permissions. removeCategories = categories deleted once they are empty.",
